  "about": {
    "title": "About the Power of the Duelist set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Power of the Duelist is a Yu-Gi-Oh! TCG booster set released on 16 August 2006, in the GX era. It has 60 cards, and with the 25 other rarities there are 85 to collect in all.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 60 cards, each in its main rarity) or the <b>Master set</b> (all 85, adding the 25 other rarities).",
